@startuml
actor Пользователь
participant "WebUI" as UI
participant "APIGateway" as API
participant "TicketService" as Ticket
participant "RouteService" as Route
participant "PaymentService" as Payment
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "EmailService" as Email

Пользователь -> UI: Поиск маршрута
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /routes?from=X&to=Y&date=Z
activate API
API -> Route: searchRoutes()
activate Route
Route -> DB: SELECT routes
activate DB
DB --> Route: List<Route>
deactivate DB
Route --> API: Routes found
deactivate Route
API --> UI: 200 OK + Routes
deactivate API
UI --> Пользователь: Отображение маршрутов
deactivate UI

Пользователь -> UI: Выбор поезда и места
activate UI
UI -> UI: Проверка доступности

alt Пользователь не авторизован
    UI -> Пользователь: Форма входа/регистрации
    Пользователь -> UI: Данные входа
    UI -> API: POST /auth/login
    activate API
    API --> UI: JWT Token
    deactivate API
end

UI -> API: POST /tickets/book
activate API
API -> Ticket: createBooking()
activate Ticket
Ticket -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB
Ticket -> DB: INSERT booking
Ticket -> DB: UPDATE seat status
Ticket --> API: Booking created
deactivate Ticket
deactivate DB
API --> UI: 201 Created
deactivate API

UI -> API: POST /payments/process
activate API
API -> Payment: processPayment()
activate Payment
Payment -> Payment: Проверка карты
Payment -> DB: UPDATE booking status
activate DB
DB --> Payment: OK
deactivate DB
Payment --> API: Payment success
deactivate Payment
API --> UI: 200 OK
deactivate API

par Параллельная отправка
    API -> Email: sendTicket()
    activate Email
    Email --> API: Sent
    deactivate Email
and
    API -> Email: sendReceipt()
    activate Email
    Email --> API: Sent
    deactivate Email
end par

UI --> Пользователь: Билет куплен
deactivate UI

@enduml

